# ordin-usage-planner: how much work ordin takes on and when it pauses
error-reuse-expiry-invalid = A saved answer can be reused for 7 days after it was given, and no longer.
error-reuse-input-newer = That answer can't be reused because something it relied on has changed since.
error-reuse-request-invalid = Your question is empty or too long. Keep it under 8,000 characters.
error-usage-above-profile-limit = That setting is higher than your company allows. Choose a lower one.
error-usage-agents-out-of-range = Choose between 1 and 3 agents working at once.
error-usage-daily-pause-reached = ordin has paused for today because it reached its daily limit. It will carry on tomorrow.
error-usage-fixed-by-company = Your company has set that for you, so you can't change it.
error-usage-journal-unavailable = ordin couldn't record your usage just now. Try again in a moment.
error-usage-level-unknown = ordin doesn't recognise that usage level. Choose one from the list.
error-usage-not-answer-only = Only work that just gave an answer can be saved for reuse, not work that changed things or was approved.
error-usage-store-unavailable = ordin couldn't reach its usage settings. Try again in a moment.
